/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (Advanced autonomy and SLAM systems depend on accurate, well-calibrated inertial data. In practice, sensor bias, misalignment, timing errors, and unreliable middleware configurations often dominate system error, especially in GPS-denied scenarios. Without a robust inertial platform that supports calibration, validation, and reproducibility, higher-level navigation and SLAM algorithms cannot be reliably evaluated or deployed)
