218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 104 0 R
/E (Design and analysis of a CubeSat atmospheric descent experiment focused on dynamic modeling, multi-sensor state estimation, and post-flight reconstruction. The project integrated IMU, GPS, and multi-Pitot pressure sensing to estimate velocity, attitude, and aerodynamic behavior during descent. Analytical modeling, CFD simulations, and experimental data were combined to validate system performance and reconstruct the vehicle trajectory.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
