<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (Development of an urban air-mobility \(UAM\) simulation pipeline that transforms real satellite imagery of a city into a discrete airspace grid and a 3D virtual environment, and then uses that representation to simulate drone traffic in ROS2/Gazebo. The workflow converts Copernicus multispectral imagery into a pixel matrix of free and occupied cells, extracts aerial corridors above streets and open areas, reconstructs the city in Blender, and exports the scene to ROS2 so that UAVs can fly along the corridors using waypoints generated by the algorithm.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
